#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteCategory.title"
msgid "Delete Class"
msgstr "நீக்கு வகுப்பு"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteCategory.desc"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete the class {{name}}? This will permanently "
"delete all associated images and require re-training the model."
msgstr ""
"அரே you sure you want பெறுநர் நீக்கு the வகுப்பு {{name}}? This will "
"permanently நீக்கு அனைத்தும் associated படங்கள் and require re-training the "
"model."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteCategory.minClassesTitle"
msgid "Cannot Delete Class"
msgstr "Cannot நீக்கு வகுப்பு"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteCategory.minClassesDesc"
msgid ""
"A classification model must have at least 2 classes. Add another class "
"before deleting this one."
msgstr ""
"A classification மாதிரியுரு must have at least 2 classes. கூட்டு another "
"வகுப்பு before deleting this one."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteModel.title"
msgid "Delete Classification Model"
msgstr "நீக்கு Classification மாதிரியுரு"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteModel.single"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete {{name}}? This will permanently delete all "
"associated data including images and training data. This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"அரே you sure you want பெறுநர் நீக்கு {{name}}? This will permanently நீக்கு "
"அனைத்தும் associated தகவல்கள் including படங்கள் and training data. This "
"செயல் cannot be undone."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteModel.desc"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete {{count}} model? This will permanently "
"delete all associated data including images and training data. This action "
"cannot be undone."
msgid_plural ""
"Are you sure you want to delete {{count}} models? This will permanently "
"delete all associated data including images and training data. This action "
"cannot be undone."
msgstr[0] ""
"அரே you sure you want பெறுநர் நீக்கு {{count}} model? This will permanently "
"நீக்கு அனைத்தும் associated தகவல்கள் including படங்கள் and training data. "
"This செயல் cannot be undone."
msgstr[1] ""
"Are you sure you want பெறுநர் நீக்கு {{count}} models? This will permanently"
" நீக்கு அனைத்தும் associated data including படங்கள் and training data. This "
"செயல் cannot be undone."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.title"
msgid "Edit Classification Model"
msgstr "தொகு Classification மாதிரியுரு"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.descriptionState"
msgid ""
"Edit the classes for this state classification model. Changes will require "
"retraining the model."
msgstr ""
"தொகு the வகுப்புகள் க்கு this state classification model. Changes will "
"require retraining the model."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.descriptionObject"
msgid ""
"Edit the object type and classification type for this object classification "
"model."
msgstr ""
"தொகு the பொருள் வகை and classification வகை க்கு this பொருள் classification "
"model."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.enabled"
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "இயக்கப்பட்டது"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.enabledDesc"
msgid ""
"Run this model. When disabled, it stops running and no longer classifies."
msgstr ""
"ஓடு this model. When disabled, it stops running and இல்லை longer classifies."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.saveAttempts"
msgid "Save Attempts"
msgstr "சேமி Attempts"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.saveAttemptsDesc"
msgid ""
"Number of classification attempt images to keep for the recent "
"classifications UI."
msgstr ""
"எண் of classification attempt படங்கள் பெறுநர் keep க்கு the recent "
"classifications UI."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.motion"
msgid "Run on Motion"
msgstr "ஓடு on இயக்கம்"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.motionDesc"
msgid "Run classification when motion is detected within the configured crop."
msgstr ""
"ஓடு classification when இயக்கம் is detected within the configured crop."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.interval"
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "இடைவேளை"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.intervalDesc"
msgid ""
"Seconds between periodic classification runs. Leave empty to run only on "
"motion."
msgstr ""
"நொடிகள் between காலசுழற்சியான classification runs. Leave வெறுமை பெறுநர் ஓடு "
"only on motion."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.intervalPlaceholder"
msgid "No interval"
msgstr "இல்லை இடைவேளை"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.stateClassesInfo"
msgid "Model updated. Retrain the model for the class changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"மாதிரியுரு updated. Retrain the மாதிரியுரு க்கு the வகுப்பு changes பெறுநர் "
"take effect."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.errors.saveAttemptsInvalid"
msgid "Save attempts must be a whole number of 0 or greater"
msgstr "சேமி attempts must be a whole எண் of 0 or greater"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "edit.errors.intervalInvalid"
msgid "Interval must be a whole number greater than 0"
msgstr "இடைவேளை must be a whole எண் greater than 0"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteDatasetImages.title"
msgid "Delete Dataset Images"
msgstr "நீக்கு Dataset படங்கள்"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteDatasetImages.desc"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete {{count}} image from {{dataset}}? This "
"action cannot be undone and will require re-training the model."
msgid_plural ""
"Are you sure you want to delete {{count}} images from {{dataset}}? This "
"action cannot be undone and will require re-training the model."
msgstr[0] ""
"அரே you sure you want பெறுநர் நீக்கு {{count}} படம் இருந்து {{dataset}}? "
"This செயல் cannot be undone and will require re-training the model."
msgstr[1] ""
"அரே you sure you want பெறுநர் நீக்கு {{count}} படங்கள் இருந்து {{dataset}}? "
"This செயல் cannot be undone and will require re-training the model."

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteTrainImages.title"
msgid "Delete Train Images"
msgstr "ரயில் படங்களை நீக்கவும்"

#, i18next-interpolation
msgctxt "deleteTrainImages.desc"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete {{count}} image? This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgid_plural ""
"Are you sure you want to delete {{count}} images? This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr[0] ""
"{{count}} படத்தை நிச்சயமாக நீக்க விரும்புகிறீர்களா? இந்தச் செயலைச் "
"செயல்தவிர்க்க முடியாது."
msgstr[1] ""
"{{count}} படங்களை நிச்சயமாக நீக்க விரும்புகிறீர்களா? இந்தச் செயலைச் "
"செயல்தவிர்க்க முடியாது."

